      "content": "OpenAPI specification for SAML 2.0 Single Sign-On HTTP bindings as defined in the OASIS SAML 2.0 Bindings specification (saml-bindings-2.0-os). Covers the HTTP Redirect Binding and HTTP POST Binding used for AuthnRequest and Response message exchange between Service Providers and Identity Providers.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Kin Lane\n Email: info@apievangelist.com",
